ound","path":"/game/16247300990-impossible-obby","slug":"16247300990-impossible-obby","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3d567ced693f85405c7fc5f48c06e5c2/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/af38d84dbb6e4f3ec19f0f856e7b0751/150/150/Image/Jpeg","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":8,"visitor":60259303,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-02-11T19:27:36.545Z","creator":{"name":"IMPOSSIBLE OBBY GAMES!","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":118677256126351,"name":"🐟 Bomb Fishing!","desc":"Throw bombs into the lake and discover crazy hidden fish! 🐟\nFrom common catches to ultra SECRET fish, every explosion could change your luck.\n\n💥 Features:\n\nTons of unique fish to collect\nSecret & ultra rare fish\nMutations: Normal, Golden, Diamond & more\nSteal fish from other players 😈\nShow off your rarest catches\nGlobal leaderboards 🏆\n\nWill you become the #1 Bomb Fisher? 🎣💣","path":"/game/118677256126351-bomb-fishing","slug":"118677256126351-bomb-fishing","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5003688cfa291ea944f2aa1ea2bf4552/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-1d1d9045971b25555b1f24ec555688ec/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":8,"visitor":10200331,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-08T17:06:22.698Z","creator":{"name":"Fishing Adventure","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":87638937916386,"name":"The Fields [UPDATE]","desc":"30-09-2026\nv0.4.1 - Fresh Coat of Paint\n\n\"Life rots quickest where it grows fastest.\"\n\nMonths have passed since HEMCOR sealed off The [REDACTED] Fields. The news won't stop circling the story, speaking only of HEMCOR and their explanations as “irregularities in agricultural life” and the need for “further study.”\n\nBut you don't trust them.\nAnd for reasons that are known only to you, you step into the quarantine zone.\n\nM - View controls (PC)\n\nThis game is in early access, expect a few bugs.\nEVERYTHING IN THE GAME IS SUBJECT TO CHANGE.\n\nThe Fields is inspired by @Octik's \"TRAVERSAL\", Acid Wizard Studio's \"Darkwood\", and Badorkbee's \"Isle\".","path":"/game/87638937916386-the-fields-update","slug":"87638937916386-the-fields-update","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d45d9e8e478431fc4aa04904cc8d0652/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3330c96897af4e344f2eb538b8b0aafa/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":8,"visitor":3224423,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-07T20:24:32.851Z","creator":{"name":"Not-a-Social Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":15717957289,"name":"[RELEASE] Jujutsu Odyssey","desc":"PLAYABLE ON MOBILE /PC /CONSOLE📱🖥️🎮\n\n--------------------------------------------------------\nAs a Jujutsu Sorcerer, you’ll follow the gripping storyline, standing alongside iconic characters as you face cursed spirits, uncover ancient mysteries, and confront challenges that test your resolve. \n\nYour cursed technique—an extension of your spirit—shapes how you combat the darkness, whether by wielding flames that scorch the battlefield or slashing down your foes all at once. Mastery demands growth, discipline, and the courage to push your limits for the sake of humanity. \n\nWith every battle and decision, you become a vital thread in the unfolding tale, forging a legacy of strength, loyalty, and heroism. Will you embrace your destiny as The Strongest Sorcerer of Today?\n----------------------------------------\n\nCursed Wombs spawn every 1-2 hours under Cursed Trees, and de-spawn after 30 minutes.\n\nControls for all platforms: https://devforum.roblox.com/t/jujutsu-odyssey-controls/3439164 ","path":"/game/15717957289-release-jujutsu-odyssey","slug":"15717957289-release-jujutsu-odyssey","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d240c135bea32a430b270ea6e6119dac/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.